0126+  99C4             		;* Move ship according to correography table     *
0127+  99C4             		;*                                               *
0128+  99C4             		;* Data: Each byte (1 for each ship) is broken   *
0129+  99C4             		;* up into two parts. The top nibble is the      *
0130+  99C4             		;* number of frames (x4) to do a move. The bottom*
0131+  99C4             		;* nibble is the direction to move. One of 16    *
0132+  99C4             		;* directions is picked (0=no motion). 1=22.5 deg*
0133+  99C4             		;* (clockwise) up to 15=337.5 deg. Starting from *
0134+  99C4             		;* 90 deg straight up (ie: 1=112.5 deg, 15=67.5) *
0135+  99C4             		;* Note that there is no straight up motion.     *
0136+  99C4             		;*************************************************
