0049+  BB1A             ;* that are active into the map on the top of the
0050+  BB1A             ;* screen.                                       
0051+  BB1A             ;*                                               
0052+  BB1A             ;* Inputs:  frame,objst,objxh,objyh              
0053+  BB1A             ;*                                               
0054+  BB1A             ;* Outputs: vectors to vglist                    
0055+  BB1A             ;*                                               
0056+  BB1A             ;* Uses:    temp6,vglist(see also locmap)        
0057+  BB1A             ;*************************************************
