0006+  D52D             ;*****************************************************
0007+  D52D             ;* Coin65 - 650X Universal Coin Routine              *
0008+  D52D             ;*                                                   *
0009+  D52D             ;* Programmers: Downend & Albaugh                    *
0010+  D52D             ;* Revised for Havoc 10-27-83                        *
