0003+  D711                 .sbttl "Game Sequence Control"
0004+  D711             ;***************************************************
0005+  D711             ;* This controls all the different states and state
0006+  D711             ;* transitions in the game 
0007+  D711             ;***************************************************
0008+  D711             ;* Things that must happen before seqence can adv.
0009+  D711             ;* Game must be Playing : gamest = minus
0010+  D711             ;* Player must be alive : manstat = Positive but not zero
0011+  D711             ;* If player is dead (manstat = 0), score buffer must be empty : scrbuf,scrbuf+1 == 0
