0053+  EE87                     ;***********************************************************
0054+  EE87                     ;* For reference, the following variables contain
0055+  EE87                     ;* the following data, you can call msgent directly
0056+  EE87                     ;* to print text this way. Scaling is set to 2B/0L.
0057+  EE87                     ;* Use calls farther down to roll your own
0058+  EE87                     ;*
0059+  EE87                     ;*  vdata: (word) Pointer to Text
0060+  EE87                     ;*  msg_x: X Position
0061+  EE87                     ;*  msg_y: Y Position
0062+  EE87                     ;*  msg_idx: Message Index
0063+  EE87                     ;***********************************************************
