0374+  F183             ;* any paging if necessary.                     
0375+  F183             ;*                                              
0376+  F183             ;* Seed Address     Pages   Paging               
0377+  F183             ;* 00   8000-BFFF   64.     No              
0378+  F183             ;* 01   C000-FFFF   64.     No              
0379+  F183             ;* 02   2000-3FFF   32.     PRGM 0          
0380+  F183             ;* 03   2000-3FFF   32.     PRGM 1          
0381+  F183             ;* 04   2000-3FFF   32.     PRGM 2          
0382+  F183             ;* 05   2000-3FFF   32.     PRGM 3   
0383+  F183             ;* 06   2000-3FFF   32.     PRGM 4         
0384+  F183             ;* 07   2000-3FFF   32.     PRGM 5          
0385+  F183             ;* 08   2000-3FFF   32.     PRGM 6          
0386+  F183             ;* 09   2000-3FFF   32.     PRGM 7   
0387+  F183             ;* 10   5000-5FFF   16.     No              
0388+  F183             ;* 11   6000-7FFF   32.     VCTR 0          
0389+  F183             ;* 12   6000-7FFF   32.     VCTR 1          
0390+  F183             ;* 13   6000-7FFF   32.     VCTR 2          
0391+  F183             ;* 14   6000-7FFF   32.     VCTR 3      
0392+  F183             ;*                                              
0393+  F183             ;* To set VCTR paging, a small program must be  
0394+  F183             ;* transferred to the vector RAM which does a   
0395+  F183             ;* STAT and PAGE instruction then halts. This   
0396+  F183             ;* is the only way to assure that the proper    
0397+  F183             ;* vector page is selected. The vector gen      
0398+  F183             ;* must not be running during the test.         
0399+  F183             ;* To set program page, a store to global addr  
0400+  F183             ;* ROMPG must be done with the desired page #   
0401+  F183             ;*                                       
0402+  F183             ;* (temp2,+1)    = scratch                
0403+  F183             ;* (pgcstbl,+14d = 15 checksums for ROM's 
0404+  F183             ;* (temp3)       = diag step #    
0405+  F183             ;************************************************
0406+  F183             ?stest3  
0407+  F183 A9 00       		lda #00
0408+  F185 A8                  tay 
0409+  F186 AA                  tax 
